cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite the paper below."
title: "DualFaith at NLPCC-2026 Task 10: Faithfulness Verification for Scientific Reports against Experimental Results and Citation Evidence"
abstract: >-
  DualFaith is the Team XJDX_001 system for NLPCC-2026 Shared Task 10,
  Reliability of AI-Assisted Scientific Reporting. Track 1 fine-tunes
  Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct with LoRA and a recall-additive union ensemble for
  sentence-level faithfulness labeling against figures and tables, ranking
  second of 11 teams. Track 2 freezes a fused four-reranker evidence list and
  stacks a DeBERTa evidence reader, a claim-only classifier, an external NLI
  posterior and a logistic-regression meta-classifier for citation support,
  ranking first of 15 teams.
